      "JACKIE: When we get there we can pretend we don't speak English. You can be my mom and I’ll be your daughter.\nJACKIE: How do you say, ”two tickets, please” in your language?\nGLORIA: Dalawang ticket nga po!\nJACKIE: Dalaweng ticket... Two tickets...",
      "GLORIA: Meteorite.\nJACKIE: Meteorite.",
      "JACKIE: It's so cool, like you really are in outer space...\nELLEN: I think you’re going to be an astronomer when you grow up.\nJACKIE: You do?\nELLEN: Yes.",
      "GLORIA: It’s time for bed.\nGLORIA: Shall I fluff your pillow?\nJACKIE: Hmm.\nGLORIA: Your blanket, too?",
      "ELLEN: Hi!\nGLORIA: Good morning!\nJACKIE: Hey.\nELLEN: Jackie! Jackie! Jackie!"
